# Tracer: inferred forall premise replay
#
# Before (verified by Litex but rejected by To-Lean):
# forall x R+:
#     x > 0
# Former behavior: strict compilation stopped with
# `the universal-object MVP does not yet emit inferred forall premises`.
#
# Now (verified and emitted):
forall x R+:
    x > 0
# Current behavior: the emitter proves one local `0 < x` fact from the exact
# verifier-retained `x $in R+` FactId, registers it, and cites it for `x > 0`.
#
# Boundary: `forall x N+: x > 0` remains rejected until its distinct inference
# chain has complete checked To-Lean adapters; the emitter never uses target
# proof search to fill the gap.
# Evidence: target/release/litex -compact -isolated -runner -f examples/05_compiler_interop/compile_to_lean_inferred_forall_premise.lit
# Rust: cargo test --release inferred_forall_premise_replays_its_exact_fact_id -- --nocapture
# Lean: LITEX_LEAN_PROJECT=lean cargo test --release inferred_forall_premise_compiles_with_mathlib -- --ignored --nocapture
